---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Practice — Alexis 智立"
  description="Practice around co-living, commons, and alternative spaces."
  mycelium="subtle"
>
  <article class="container reading">
    <header class="about-sub-header">
      <h1>Practice</h1>
      <p class="about-sub-intro">
        Experiments in co-living, commons, and alternative spaces — and how
        they grow as part of a wider ecology.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Co-living and commons</h2>
      <p>
        This section can hold concrete notes on co-living and commons practice:
        how specific communities are organized, how daily life is arranged, and
        what kinds of support and friction appear.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Alternative spaces</h2>
      <p>
        You can expand here on spaces like Dweller, Protopia, and other nodes
        in the map of alternative spaces — how they are made, and how they
        relate to one another.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="back-link">
      <a href="/about">← Back to About</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-sub-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .about-sub-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .back-link a {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .back-link a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>

